# NPC platform pairing

This repo is part of a **two-repo platform** with `NPC-Chat-Middleware` (Python) and `NPC-Yaml-Editor-CSharp` (C#).

## Git (required)

Follow **git-branch-and-pr-workflow** in this repo: branch off `main`, **commit on the feature branch before finishing**, never commit to `main`, open PRs with `--base main`. Use the same branch slug in both repos for paired work.

When changing API routes, proxy behavior, DM/voice flows, JSON contracts, or audio format:

1. Check the other repository for callers/implementations.
2. Use the **npc-platform-coordinator** skill for branch + paired PR workflow.
3. Read yaml-editor `docs/MIDDLEWARE_INTEGRATION.md` before contract changes.

